Enhancement: Add `--keep-original` option to `tag` command

The `tag` command always removed the original snapshots after creating the
snapshots with the modified tags, which required an exclusive lock on the
repository. The new `--keep-original` option keeps the original snapshots,
such that the `tag` command only requires a non-exclusive lock and can run
concurrently with other operations like `backup`.

